    "body": "This issue is unfortunately looking like the biggest blocker for getting v0.45.0 out.\r\nI'm leaning toward `prefix` being the best solution for this sort of thing, but that will end up increasing the complexity of the prompt yet again, and will need some logic to be re-added to the prompt.\r\n\r\nPaging @heyrict in case they have thoughts on the matter.",
