    "updated_at": "2020-09-06T22:30:43Z",
    "body": "What about adding a post-processing function that strips the prefixes after the whole format string is generated?\r\n\r\nThe easiest one is using a regex e.g. `s/^(in|at|on|with) *//`.\r\n\r\nIf all prefixes are some non-variable text following a space, a boolean option should be sufficient.",
